{
  "$note": "僕役宮（2026-10-12）：天梁.僕役。《深造講義》下篇 宮垣論 僕役宮 p.516–530。官非、盜竊、色禍、受出賣、乘人之危一類斷語不用；天姚、陰煞、天巫、天刑等引擎冇嘅星不用；要分廟陷嘅條文暫不用。原書交友宮主下屬、晚輩，兼論朋友。",
  "topic": {
    "id": "天梁.僕役",
    "palace": "僕役",
    "stars": [
      "天梁"
    ]
  },
  "rules": [
    {
      "id": "僕役.天梁.輔佐",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "any": [
          {
            "star": [
              "左輔",
              "右弼"
            ],
            "at": "sifang"
          },
          {
            "star": [
              "天魁",
              "天鉞"
            ],
            "at": "sifang"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "天梁見〔輔佐吉星〕，你交遊廣闊，下屬眾多。",
      "en": "Tian Liang meets 〔helper stars〕: your circle is wide and your staff are many.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.天梁.1",
        "quote": "除非见辅佐吉曜"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.天梁.祿",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "any": [
          {
            "hua": "祿",
            "star": "天梁",
            "at": "same"
          },
          {
            "star": "祿存",
            "at": "same"
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "天梁化祿或與祿存同宮，你的朋友、下屬容易有私心。",
      "en": "Tian Liang in Abundance or with Lu Cun: your friends and staff tend to look after themselves.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.天梁.2",
        "quote": "则主友人、下属有利私之心"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.天梁.煞",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "star": [
          "擎羊",
          "陀羅",
          "火星",
          "鈴星"
        ],
        "at": "sifang"
      },
      "text": "天梁會到〔煞星〕，你容易因朋友或下屬生出是非糾紛。",
      "en": "Tian Liang meets 〔harsh stars〕: friends or staff bring arguments and disputes.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.天梁.3",
        "quote": "因友人或下属而起是非纠纷"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.天梁.吉",
      "role": "refine",
      "when": {
        "all": [
          {
            "any": [
              {
                "hua": "權",
                "star": "天梁",
                "at": "same"
              },
              {
                "hua": "科",
                "star": "天梁",
                "at": "same"
              }
            ]
          },
          {
            "not": {
              "star": "祿存",
              "at": "same"
            }
          }
        ]
      },
      "text": "天梁化權化科，結交到正直無私、有義氣的朋友和下屬。",
      "en": "Tian Liang in Authority or Recognition: you attract upright, selfless and loyal friends and staff.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.天梁.4",
        "quote": "及招正直无私有义的友人及下属"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.天梁.馬",
      "role": "limit",
      "when": {
        "star": "天馬",
        "at": "same"
      },
      "text": "同宮有天馬，你的知交容易離散，也常換手下。",
      "en": "With Tian Ma in the palace, close friends drift away and staff keep changing.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.天梁.5",
        "quote": "知交易散，亦主时时更换手下"
      }
    },
    {
      "id": "僕役.天梁.本",
      "role": "base",
      "when": {
        "not": {
          "any": [
            {
              "star": [
                "左輔",
                "右弼"
              ],
              "at": "sifang"
            },
            {
              "star": [
                "天魁",
                "天鉞"
              ],
              "at": "sifang"
            }
          ]
        }
      },
      "text": "天梁是孤剋之星，不見輔佐吉星，交遊不廣，下屬也不多。",
      "en": "Tian Liang is a loner star: without helper stars your circle is small and you have few staff.",
      "source": {
        "passage": "deep.僕役.天梁.1",
        "quote": "天梁为孤克之星"
      }
    }
  ]
}